{"articleNo":"108489","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=108489&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014-2학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 선발 결과 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.06.27","hit":"3831","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014학년도 2학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 입사 신청자 중 합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니, 해당 학생들은 등록 기간 내에 등록하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 2014-2학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 입사 신청 현황 및 합격 여부</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▶ 신 청 자 : 65명 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▶ 합 격 자 : 60명</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▶ 불합격자 : 5명 (전화 개별 통보)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 불합격자는 공지사항 참고하여 2014. 6. 30(월)부터 실시하는 2014-2학기 생활관 입사 신청에 접수하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 합격자는 메시지로 개별 통보하며, 메시지를 받지 못한 학생은 행정실로 문의하시기 바랍니다.(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">등록기간에는 별도 개인별 통보가 없으니, 등록에 착오 없으시기 바람</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 생활관비 등록</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">▶ 등록기간 : 2014. 7. 16(수) 10:00 ~ 7. 18(금) 16:00까지(개인별 가상계좌로 납부)</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 생활관비 납부 및 확인 방법 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(가상계좌 납부)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">▶</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조\" l